{"seq":2,"slug":"ownership-and-borrowing","title":"所有权与借用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/ownership-and-borrowing","wordCount":838,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"所有权与借用\">所有权与借用</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Swift 5.9 引入了所有权（Ownership）相关特性（SE-0366, SE-0377），包括 <code>consuming</code>、<code>borrowing</code> 参数修饰符和 <code>~Copyable</code>（不可复制类型）。这些特性受 Rust 所有权模型启发，让 Swift 能够表达更精细的值生命周期管理，在避免不必要的拷贝的同时保证内存安全。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    OWN[&quot;所有权模型&quot;] --&gt; CON[&quot;consuming 消耗&quot;]&#10;    OWN --&gt; BOR[&quot;borrowing 借用&quot;]&#10;    OWN --&gt; NC[&quot;~Copyable 不可复制&quot;]&#10;    OWN --&gt; MV[&quot;move 语义&quot;]&#10;    OWN --&gt; ANN[&quot;所有权注解&quot;]&#10;    NC --&gt; UNI[&quot;唯一资源建模&quot;]&#10;    NC --&gt; RAII[&quot;RAII 模式&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    OWN[\"所有权模型\"] --&gt; CON[\"consuming 消耗\"]\n    OWN --&gt; BOR[\"borrowing 借用\"]\n    OWN --&gt; NC[\"~Copyable 不可复制\"]\n    OWN --&gt; MV[\"move 语义\"]\n    OWN --&gt; ANN[\"所有权注解\"]\n    NC --&gt; UNI[\"唯一资源建模\"]\n    NC --&gt; RAII[\"RAII 模式\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>所有权与借用（SE-0366、SE-0377）让 Swift 能<strong>显式表达值的所有权意图</strong>，其目标是在保证内存安全的前提下消除不必要的拷贝，并支持唯一资源建模。这套模型受 Rust 启发，围绕「谁拥有值、值能否被复制、所有权何时转移」展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>borrowing</code> 与 <code>consuming</code> 参数</strong>——<code>borrowing</code> 只读借用、不拷贝；<code>consuming</code> 转移所有权、调用者不再使用该值；</li>\n<li><strong><code>~Copyable</code>（不可复制 / move-only 类型）</strong>——禁止隐式复制，确保资源只有唯一拥有者；</li>\n<li><strong><code>consume</code> 操作符</strong>——显式转移所有权，转移后原变量不可再用（对可复制类型也能避免多余拷贝）；</li>\n<li><strong>方法所有权修饰</strong>——<code>borrowing</code>（默认，self 仍有效）、<code>mutating</code>（可变借用）、<code>consuming</code>（消耗 self，调用后失效）；</li>\n<li><strong>应用模式</strong>——天然适合 RAII 与唯一资源令牌（文件句柄、连接、事务）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>所有权模型用「借用 / 消耗 / 不可复制」把值的生命周期写进类型签名，让编译器帮你消除拷贝并守住资源唯一性。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"consuming-与-borrowing\">consuming 与 borrowing</h2><p>Swift 函数参数默认使用隐式的所有权约定。新的显式修饰符让开发者表达精确意图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct LargeBuffer {&#10;    var data: [UInt8]&#10;&#10;    func process(borrowing input: LargeBuffer) -&gt; Int {&#10;        input.data.count&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    consuming func transformed() -&gt; LargeBuffer {&#10;        var copy = self&#10;        copy.data.reverse()&#10;        return copy&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LargeBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UInt8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">borrowing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input: LargeBuffer) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input.data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    consuming</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LargeBuffer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> copy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        copy.data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> copy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>修饰符</th>\n<th>所有权行为</th>\n<th>是否拷贝</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认（隐式）</td>\n<td>编译器决定</td>\n<td>按需拷贝</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>borrowing</code></td>\n<td>只读借用</td>\n<td>不拷贝</td>\n<td>只需读取，不消耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>consuming</code></td>\n<td>转移所有权</td>\n<td>不拷贝</td>\n<td>调用者不再使用该值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inout</code></td>\n<td>可变借用</td>\n<td>不拷贝</td>\n<td>需要修改原值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func printInfo(borrowing value: String) {&#10;    print(value)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func takeOwnership(consuming value: String) {&#10;    print(&quot;Took: \\(value)&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;var name = &quot;Swift&quot;&#10;printInfo(borrowing: name)       // name 仍然有效&#10;takeOwnership(consuming: name)    // name 的所有权转移&#10;// print(name) // ⚠️ 使用 consuming 后，name 可能不再有效\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">borrowing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> takeOwnership</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consuming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Took: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(value)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Swift\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">printInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">borrowing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: name)       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// name 仍然有效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">takeOwnership</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consuming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: name)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// name 的所有权转移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// print(name) // ⚠️ 使用 consuming 后，name 可能不再有效</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"copyable-不可复制类型\">~Copyable：不可复制类型</h2><p><code>~Copyable</code>（也称 noncopyable 或 move-only 类型）表示该类型的值不能被隐式复制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct FileHandle: ~Copyable {&#10;    private let fd: Int32&#10;&#10;    init(path: String) throws {&#10;        fd = open(path, O_RDONLY)&#10;        guard fd &gt;= 0 else { throw FileError.cannotOpen }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func read(count: Int) -&gt; Data {&#10;        var buffer = [UInt8](repeating: 0, count: count)&#10;        _ = Darwin.read(fd, &amp;buffer, count)&#10;        return Data(buffer)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    deinit {&#10;        close(fd)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FileHandle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">~</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Copyable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fd: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> open</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path, O_RDONLY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FileError.cannotOpen }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">UInt8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeating</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        _</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Darwin.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-